{{field-4}} |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CD & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ 2 & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 & \\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-3)+(-\\frac{3}{4})\\cdot 1\\, & \\,\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}+(-\\frac{3}{4})\\cdot 4 \\\\ 2\\cdot (-3)+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 1\\, & \\,2\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{3}{4}\\, & \\,\\frac{5}{4}-3 \\\\ -6+\\frac{1}{3}\\, & \\,5+\\frac{4}{3}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{9}{4} & -\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{17}{3} & \\frac{19}{3}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186276946 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5dbfd5f3-553b-5276-8716-bbceddefc4d3" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying 2x2 Square Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1555068a-0445-58af-8b2a-832e990fc94a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276948}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1555068a-0445-58af-8b2a-832e990fc94a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276948} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb4397fe-fadd-5504-be0a-7ca219238904" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276947} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ddc7c63-22ee-5a1a-9e77-a009cdf8db61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276950}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1ddc7c63-22ee-5a1a-9e77-a009cdf8db61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276950} :answer-field/id #uuid "3386e585-a03d-5cfe-8e4b-59fb3dce2b1c" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/t